  "label": "The lion is mapped as the non-conformist persona",
  "description": "The visual entity 'lion' is mapped onto the textual entity 'I'm not one of those people' to represent the speaker's self-identification as a non-conformist. The lion's aggressive, defiant expression (visual material) is used to symbolize the speaker's rejection of societal conformity (textual material). This mapping is central to the meme's intent, using the lion as a cultural symbol of strength and defiance to embody the speaker's identity.",
